        ("finally bei break 2 / continue 2: jedes finally laeuft, auch aus catch, throw im finally, in Methoden", """
            class E1 : Exception { construct() { } }
            string log = ""
            for (int a = 0; a < 3; a++) {
                try {
                    foreach (b in [1, 2, 3]) {
